                                                "example_id": "97ee5f8c-857e-4175-a9de-6f0daf35e67c",
                                                "sense_id": "e3c1ad26-6d1f-3aa9-bdad-865359704376",
                                                "text": "[…] Q was a Queer-screen, that served as a blind; / R was a Reader, with flimsies well lined; […]"
